  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Historically one of the most significant open-source EHR systems — the backbone of the US Veterans Affairs healthcare system for decades, covering millions of patients across 170+ medical centres. Apache 2.0, OSEHRA/WorldVistA-governed. Marked Assess rather than Adopt due to legacy MUMPS tech stack, declining open-source community activity (last release 2020), and the VA's active migration away to Oracle Cerner. Still deployed at scale by the Indian Health Service (RPMS). Relevant for organisations with existing MUMPS infrastructure or for historical reference.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
